      {
        "id": 71183,
        "name": "phantaskippy",
        "username": "phantaskippy",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-27T11:47:30.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Always game for these, I really enjoy them.</p><p>Key moments of the game:</p><p>Fanatic blowing up everything with Last Days, we have two Fanatic fans in my group, but we've probably had one or two plays of Last Days, and I've never seen Omni go off like that, that was a crazy turn. &nbsp;I imagine her yelling \"You have been measured, and found wanting!\" at the end as she unleashes and finishes Omni.</p><p>Tachyon's synaptic interruption, I imagine the explosive ticking down toward zero, then Tachyon runs up to it with a big grin like she's just had a great idea, and rewires it then chuckles as she watches it implode harmlessly. &nbsp;Get that split-nano second of a Tachyon grin then zips off dodging giant laser beams. &nbsp;Of course I imagine that Tachyon is having a lot of fun most fights, being the cleverest person in the room and fast enough to play around a bit.</p><p>Throat jabbing Omni: &nbsp;I imagine Wraith having sneaked onto Omnitron and blowing up his targetting sensors, or maybe covering it with some wierd goop that interferes with it, making him impotent for a round while he repairs it.</p><p>Tachyon's Hypersonic I imagine her just running by and knocking all his guns to the side right before they fire, probably doing eenie meenie miney mo or something like that.</p><p>Other things I think happened during the fight.</p><p>I'm absolutely Certain that Tachyon makes phone calls during fights, like she makes a quip that causes her to want a pizza and so she orders one mid-fight, \"And I mean extra pepperoni, not like last time, really pile it on. &nbsp;Yeah, just look for the big broken robot, we'll be there.\" &nbsp;Other calls would be to lab assistants to turn off esperiments or get the results of tests she's running, and sometimes calling home to tell her wife she'll be late, or asking what she wants for dinner, possibly stopping into a nice restaraunt to make a reservation as the people cower. &nbsp;You know, stuff a super fast person could get away with. &nbsp;This one being in a prison I can't imagine what the call would be, probably home.</p><p>I imagine Wraith being involved in a lot of attempted things that went wrong, I think she did the most damage to enviro-targets and it was melee. Bunker being pinned down when the drones were all out there, and Ranger Jim running on walkways yelling for people to stay out of his shot, and talking to Con about where he can go to cut Omnitron off when it moves.</p>",
        "post_number": 124,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:50:16.483Z",
