        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/platinumwarlock/{size}/1869_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-08-27T12:01:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I can definitely picture that Avengers-style moment with Chrono-Ranger standing atop a pile of broken drones, yelling, \"Pile it on!\" as Omnitron desperately tries to pull out that last Electro-Pulse Explosive and bring back all those drones. &nbsp;Tachyon then zips back into the fray, Bunker starts unloading with the Flak Cannon, Wraith grapnels in after Tachyon, and Fanatic simply rises in the air, chanting in Aramaic...</p>",
