        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>I'm absolutely Certain that Tachyon makes phone calls during fights, like she makes a quip that causes her to want a pizza and so she orders one mid-fight, \"And I mean extra pepperoni, not like last time, really pile it on. &nbsp;Yeah, just look for the big broken robot, we'll be there.\" &nbsp;Other calls would be to lab assistants to turn off esperiments or get the results of tests she's running, and sometimes calling home to tell her wife she'll be late, or asking what she wants for dinner, possibly stopping into a nice restaraunt to make a reservation as the people cower. &nbsp;You know, stuff a super fast person could get away with. &nbsp;This one being in a prison I can't imagine what the call would be, probably home.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>I'm not so sure about this. &nbsp;It was Team Leader Tachyon, who strikes me as a more mature person; she's now responsible for her whole team, and less likely to go off and order pizza. &nbsp;Or, if she did order pizza, she made sure to get some for everyone.</p>",
